<title>CHINA: Peregrine sets warrant on HK &amp; China Gas.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets warrant on HK &amp; China Gas.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Tuesday it has launched 165 million American style call warrants on shares of Hong Kong and China Gas Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$16.90	 PREMIUM	    18.5PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.3133	GEARING	    5.4x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  22.JUL.98	EXER LOT	   10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	SETTLEMENT DATE  11.AUG.97</p>
<p>REFERENCE SPOT    HK$16.90	 LISTING DATE     13.AUG.97</p>
<p>NOTE - SETTLEMENT IN HONG KONG AND CHINA GAS SHARES WITH CASH</p>
<p>	  ALTERNATIVE AT DISCRETION OF ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
